{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/03/5635915/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは ○°"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/03/5635915/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、「FNS夏のうたまつり」見てくださった方有難うございますっ(* ^o^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うー、緊張したあー(｡> <｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難いことに、持ち歌含め6曲、\n素敵な方々とのコラボもさせて頂き、\n本当に光栄でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分的には沢山反省点の残る一日でしたが、それも含め、貴重な経験をさせて頂いてとても勉強になりました。\n今後も、一瞬一瞬に有り難みをもって、\n一つ一つに取り組んでいきたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、KERAさんの撮影でした(* ^o^ *)○°\n毎回楽しくて、いろんな可愛いお洋服が着てれて本当に嬉しいっ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売が楽しみ～（ミ＾o＾ミ）☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、只今発売中の『ROLa』９月号に、わたしと生駒ちゃんが載っておりますっ(丿^ω^ヽ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、電車の中づりポスターで見かけて、おお～って思いました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真は、以前 乃木どこにも来てくださった、 青山裕企さん＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/03/5635915/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、見てみてください～っ(* ^_^ *)♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/08/03/5635915/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}